OL,3,GNEWSAMeeting told park & ride will not
OL,4,Areplace other site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planned new #54m park and ride is not
OL,7,Fa replacement for another one nearby, a
OL,8,Fmeeting has heard.
OL,10,FThe Hauxton Park and Ride on the
OL,11,Foutskirts of Cambridge - proposed
OL,12,Fbecause of the "challenges" of access
OL,13,Finto the city and the biomedical campus
OL,14,F- is due to include 2,150 vehicle
OL,15,Fspaces and a new "active travel" bridge
OL,16,Fover the M11.
OL,18,FThe Greater Cambridge Partnership (GCP)
OL,19,Fjoint assembly has been told the nearby
OL,20,FTrumpington Park and Ride regularly
OL,21,Freaches 90% capacity and above.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
